PLACEHOLDER — the canonical GPL-3.0-or-later license text is fetched at
build time. The image's `/usr/share/haritica/LICENSE` will be the verbatim
GPL-3.0 text from https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt as inserted by
the Dockerfile RUN that pulls the official text.

Until publication of the separate haritica-cloud-gpl-extras repo, the
in-image LICENSE is sourced via this Dockerfile pattern — see Dockerfile.

Aggregate license: GPL-3.0-or-later.
GPL-3 components included:
  - HISAT2                        (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - subread / featureCounts       (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - leidenalg                     (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - louvain (python-louvain)      (BSD; GPL-3 by aggregation)
  - igraph (python bindings)      (GPL-2.0-or-later)

Permissively licensed deps in the same image:
  - numpy, pandas, scipy          (BSD)
  - anndata, scanpy               (BSD)
  - boto3                         (Apache-2.0)
  - awscli                        (Apache-2.0)
  - samtools                      (MIT)

See WRITTEN_OFFER.txt for source-access instructions per GPL-3 §6.
